  "document": "Under the Cards\nUnder the Cards (French: Le dessous des cartes) is a 1948 French crime film directed by André Cayatte and starring Madeleine Sologne, Serge Reggiani and Paul Meurisse. The story is loosely based on the Stavisky Affair of the 1930s. The film's sets were designed by the art director René Moulaert."
